#: ../../frescobaldi/exception.py:94
msgid ""
"We would highly appreciate if you used the button below to open a new issue "
"on GitHub, the development platform used by the Frescobaldi project, to let "
"developers know about this problem. If you have general questions, you can "
"also send them to the <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/g/"
"frescobaldi\">Frescobaldi user group</a>."
msgstr ""
"Använd gärna knappen nedan för att skapa ett ärende på GitHub, där "
